\sum_{t=t_1}^{t_2} \langle G^{-1} \bm g_t,\bm x_t-\bm x_t^\circ\rangle=\operatorname{\mathcal O}\left (\sqrt{D \left (D+\sum_{t=t_1}^{t_2-1} \lVert \mathring{\bm x}_t-\mathring{\bm x}_{t+1}\rVert_1\right )}\sqrt{\sum_{t=t_1}^{t_2} \lVert G^{-1} \bm g_t\rVert_\infty^2}\log T\right ).
