As $z^2$ is convex and $6g\log (z^8) + 8g + 7zh$ is concave, there are at most two intersections.
Hence, again denoting the larger root of $8z^2 - 6 g \log(z^8) - 8 g - 7z h = 0$ as $z_0$ (in case there is no root, let $z_0=1$), $i(z)$ is monotonic in $[z_0,+\infty)$.

